OL,3,AConverse pulls 'deeply upsetting'
OL,4,Aadvert after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican footwear brand Converse has
OL,7,Fpulled an advert that social media
OL,8,Fusers said evoked Ku Klux Klan imagery,
OL,9,Fsaying it recognised "that we got this
OL,10,Fwrong".
OL,12,FThe photo, posted to the company's
OL,13,FInstagram account, received backlash
OL,14,Fonline after critics described lighting
OL,15,Fin the image as looking like a white
OL,16,Fpointed hood.
OL,18,FA pair of shoes, dangling in the
OL,19,Fpicture, were also likened to an image
OL,20,Fof a lynching victim by social media
OL,21,Fusers.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
